eeeeee (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Listen to all keyboards at once, with hotplug support.
  * Remove --setup: no device selection needed anymore.
  * New macOS-style popup with light/dark mode and arrow-key navigation.
  * Add --version flag.

