eeeeee (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix hold_duration config parsing and memory leak.
  * Exit cleanly when no keyboard device is available.
  * Create the config directory with its parents.
  * Fix packaging metadata (license, PKGBUILD source directory).

